# Claude Code plugins installed for the space user when the image is built, so
# a space has them without a first-run download. One <plugin>@<marketplace>
# entry per line; blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# Adding a line is a real change to the image: the payload ships in a layer
# every node pulls. chrome-devtools-mcp alone is 441 MB on disk, 74 MB
# compressed, so weigh what a plugin costs against how many spaces use it.
# `claude plugin install <plugin>@<marketplace>` inside a space is always
# available for the ones that do not belong here.

chrome-devtools-mcp@claude-plugins-official
gopls-lsp@claude-plugins-official
